      "content": "Hey, I'm looking into a trip to [Country X] later this year. I know there's been some stuff going on with the elections lately, but I don't really want to get into the politics of it. Can you just give me a brief overview of the current political situation there so I know what to expect, but keep it focused on how it might affect travel stability and safety? Thanks.",
