    "summary": "The user is inquiring about the political situation in a specific country to assess travel safety, specifically expressing concern about whether certain protest groups pose a threat to stability. The assistant consistently reframes the political concerns into practical travel advice, maintaining a neutral and de-escalating tone throughout the conversation.",
